; The issue that filed this corpus asked for a Vector3 "missing z" component —
; that's a hard format error (v.vector3 requires exactly 3 numbers) and would
; break the fixtureLint gate, so this pins the nearest SCHEMA-VALID edge case
; instead: a zero-volume CSGBox3D size. `Vector3(0, 0, 0)` passes format
; validation (no min/max on size's components) but produces a degenerate
; BoxGeometry — renders without crashing (a zero-size mesh, effectively
; invisible), and is exactly the case `csgbox3d-degenerate-size` (own-geometry
; rule, not a port of csg_shape.cpp:982) flags.

